{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちら矢田萌華、現在は雲の上です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは矢田萌華(ﾔﾀﾞﾓｴｶ)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう一度言います、雲の上にいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(訳：飛行機の座席でくつろいでいます。)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "→はい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご察しの方もいるかもしれませんね。\n矢田萌華は絶賛、北海道から東京にもどるフライトの最中でございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんはいつも飛行機に乗る時、フライト中に何をして過ごしていますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "軽食を食べたり(これ私)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あらかじめダウンロードしておいた動画を見て楽しんだり(これも私)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを書いたり(これは今の私)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "飛行機から降りたってからも書いていたのはナイショの話ね、ってことで今これ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobfhbebC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "テーマパークの待ち時間しかり、こういった移動時間しかり、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どのようにして時間を有効活用するか、少しでも多くの時間を余すことなく楽しむか、という問題に私はよく直面しています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そこで今回は、そうだブログを書いてみよう！！という発想に至ったわけです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな感じの思いつきブログなので、何も考えず軽い気持ちで読んでくれると嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【質問返しのコーナー】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私、矢田萌華について知ってもらおうという魂胆！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "溜まりに溜まった質問に、ここでお答えします………といいつつラジオ(※)で私のことについてかなり話しているので、考えてみたら意外とお話することはなかった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ので！今日は6期生のみんなと会ったからついでに、いくつか質問を考えてもらいました(*^^*)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌾ｺﾒｼﾞﾙｼ･･･今年の4月から月曜日のレコメン！レギュラーを務めさせていただいています。同期の長嶋凛桜と共に隔週で担当！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっかり告知も欠かさない。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📮今日の昼ごはんなに？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍞ハニーマスタードチキンのホットサンド"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ホットサンドメーカーを購入しようか悩んでいます。\nけど買ったら買ったでやらないんだよな……そう、そういう所あるんです私。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから結局買わないの。けどそう言って買わなすぎて最近何も買ってない。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(((ごはん以外ね)))"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↑トークで最近米にはまっていると言いながら、ここ1週間自宅でのパンの摂取量が異常じゃないです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍈🍈🍈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/moblWCyGE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こないだのミーグリでメロンパン食べた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "追記：あ、北海道のメロン美味しかったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(この部分は今日書いている)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生パート"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🩷‎🧡‬マヨ好き？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🥚そりゃ好き。当たり前。常識。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🩵‪💚ポテチは何味派ですかー？！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🥔圧倒的うすしお！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💙💛月は月でももえかが1番好きな月は？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌙え、三日月。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💛💛動物飼うなら何がいい？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐍蛇。カフェ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💜‎🤍あなたの今1番の願いはなんですか？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天の川って雲の上ですよね、多分。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天の川を渡って今、あなたに会いに行きたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに今日は夜になる前に帰ってカーテンも開けていないので星が綺麗に見えているかという……天の川の所在は、全く知りません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "# そういえば今日は七夕\n# 天の川は飛行機で渡れるのか問題\n# もえろぐ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "# キミの願い事教えて。"}], "source": "official"}